A||||4||mshill||Anyone seen air adjustable shocks for the fiero front end?||||1||
Z||000000||mshill||01-03-2001||03:09 PM||||I am concerned that my kit car project will be riding too low (ST springs, 225/17/40s) in the front.  I have one of those rounded curb driveways and don't want to scrape the front end on curbs and speed bumps in parking lots.<P>IFG sells an air shock system for the front end (http://www.ifgonline.com/phantom_options.htm) but $575 is pretty steep for a pair of shocks and a compressor.  Anyone else have/seen anything along these lines?<BR>||||reg||1
